  "comment": "gscan2pdf gscan2pdf is a free and open source graphical utility that can identify and extract text from a variety of file formats. It can directly work with scanners to scan papers and then export OCR detected text content into PDF files. It also supports multiple OCR engines including Tesseract OCR, GOCR, Ocropus and Cuneiform, as long as packages for these engines are installed on your system.",
